				\begin{document}$$\:-$$\end{document}</tex-math><inline-graphic xlink:href="12888_2025_6925_Article_IEq1.gif"/></alternatives></inline-formula>0.042, respectively). After accounting for significant negative indirect mediating effects, the remaining direct effects became non-significant for the BDSI group (direct 95% CI&#x02009;=&#x02009;<inline-formula id="IEq13"><alternatives><tex-math id="d33e1178">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$\:-$$\end{document}</tex-math><inline-graphic xlink:href="12888_2025_6925_Article_IEq1.gif"/></alternatives></inline-formula>0.565 to 0.258 and <inline-formula id="IEq14"><alternatives><tex-math id="d33e1184">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
