<fig id="Fig3"><label>Fig. 3</label><caption><p>Mediation models of the Hcy-brain-cognition relationship in bipolar disorder with suicidal ideation. Mediation Effect 1 shows that after accounting for significant negative indirect mediating effects (indirect 95% CI= <inline-formula id="IEq21"><alternatives><tex-math id="d33e1244">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
