				\begin{document}$$\:-$$\end{document}</tex-math><inline-graphic xlink:href="12888_2025_6925_Article_IEq1.gif"/></alternatives></inline-formula>0.565 to 0.258). Mediation Effect 2 illustrates that after accounting for significant negative indirect mediating effects (indirect 95% CI = <inline-formula id="IEq24"><alternatives><tex-math id="d33e1262">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
