				\begin{document}$$\:-$$\end{document}</tex-math><inline-graphic xlink:href="12888_2025_6925_Article_IEq1.gif"/></alternatives></inline-formula>0.042) between Hcy and VrbL, the remaining direct effects became non-significant (direct 95% CI= <inline-formula id="IEq26"><alternatives><tex-math id="d33e1275">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
